# A list mapped element by element into a target list that list.MinItems bounds: the source list may be empty (#163).
-- source.cue --
items: [...{title: string}]
-- target.cue --
import "list"
items: [...{name: string}] & list.MinItems(1)
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {items: [for item in v0_0.items {name: item.title}]}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.items has one element per element of v0_0.items, whose length may be [0, +inf], where the target list's length must be [1, +inf] (rule copy-narrowed) @ lens.cue:2:8
